@startuml
title Pronounce Vocabulary Sequence (Mobile audio/TTS)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Pronounce Vocabulary UI" as PronounceUi
control "AudioPlaybackService\n(FE Mobile)" as AudioService
control "AudioPlayer\n(Device)" as AudioPlayer
control "FlutterTts\n(Device)" as FlutterTts

note over PronounceUi, FlutterTts
Checked in current code:
Mobile UI calls AudioPlaybackService from audio_playback_service.dart.
No backend API, request DTO, response DTO, repository, DbContext or database is used by this action.
AudioPlaybackService currently has useTestVoice = true, so pronunciation uses FlutterTts test text.
When useTestVoice is false, it plays audioUrl through AudioPlayer if present,
otherwise falls back to FlutterTts for the word text.
end note

Learner -> PronounceUi: Tap pronunciation button
PronounceUi -> AudioService: playPronunciation(word, accent, audioUrl)

alt Test voice mode enabled
    AudioService -> AudioPlayer: stop()
    AudioPlayer --> AudioService: Stopped
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: stop()
    FlutterTts --> AudioService: Stopped
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: setLanguage(en-US/en-GB)
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: setSpeechRate(0.42)\nand setPitch(1)
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: speak(testVoiceText)
    FlutterTts --> AudioService: Started or failed
    AudioService --> PronounceUi: Playback result
else Audio URL available
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: stop()
    FlutterTts --> AudioService: Stopped
    AudioService -> AudioPlayer: stop()
    AudioPlayer --> AudioService: Stopped
    AudioService -> AudioPlayer: play(UrlSource(audioUrl))
    AudioPlayer --> AudioService: Playback started
    AudioService --> PronounceUi: Playback result
else No audio URL
    AudioService -> AudioPlayer: stop()
    AudioPlayer --> AudioService: Stopped
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: stop()
    FlutterTts --> AudioService: Stopped
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: setLanguage(en-US/en-GB)
    AudioService -> FlutterTts: speak(word)
    FlutterTts --> AudioService: Started or failed
    AudioService --> PronounceUi: Playback result
end

@enduml
